\ difficulty.fam — targets, ASERT and work (docs/NODE.md, step 4), after
\ arith.fam.  As tabminer's miner/src/difficulty.rs and pow.rs: 256-bit
\ integers as 8 words (least significant first, arith.fam's wide integers),
\ the ASERT retarget (aserti3-2d) bit for bit, a block's work, and whether a
\ proof-of-work result meets a target.
\
\ ASERT's exponent needs more than 64 bits: it is worked in 4-word
\ two's-complement integers.  Not reentrant: scratch in variables.
\
\ A schedule is 21 words: the anchor's height, its parent's time (2 words,
\ signed), the half-life, the block time, the anchor's target (8 words),
\ the easiest target (8 words).
\
\ asert ( sched eh etlo ethi out -- )  out (8 words) = the target of the
\ block after the one at height eh, time etlo:ethi (signed); eh not below
\ the anchor's height.
\ bwork ( t out -- )  out = 2^256 / (t + 1), as (~t / (t + 1)) + 1, saturating.
\ meets ( digest t -- flag )  the digest (8 canonical words), read as a
\ 248-bit integer (element 0 the most significant 31 bits), is at most t.
\ wsat+ ( a b c -- )  c = a + b, 8 words, saturating.

: dva variable ;  : dvb variable ;  : dvc variable ;  : dvd variable ;  : dve variable ;
: dvs variable ;  : dvo variable ;  : dvh variable ;  : dvn variable ;  : dvf variable ;
: dvg variable ;  : dvt variable ;  : dvu variable ;
\ dvinit  the scratch (12 words each), once.
: dvinit  dva @ 0= if 30 lit alloc dva !  30 lit alloc dvb !  30 lit alloc dvc !  30 lit alloc dvd !  30 lit alloc dve ! then ;

\ ineg ( a n -- )  a = -a, n words, two's complement.
: ineg
2dup 0 lit do dup i w@ invert over i w! loop drop
1 lit swap 0 lit do
	over i w@ over +  dup 3 lit pick i w!  0= and
loop 2drop ;
: neg?  3 lit w@ 0< ;                          \ ( a -- flag )  a 4-word value is negative
\ i64! ( lo hi a -- )  a = the signed 64-bit hi:lo, sign-extended to 4 words.
: i64!
dup dvu ! 1 lit w!  dvu @ 0 lit w!
dvu @ 1 lit w@ 0< if FFFFFFFF lit else 0 lit then
dup dvu @ 2 lit w!  dvu @ 3 lit w! ;

\ factor ( f -- k )  the exponent's fractional power of two: ((195766423245049 f
\ + 971821376 f^2 + 5127 f^3 + 2^47) >> 48) + 65536, f below 2^16.
: factor
dvf !
dvb @ 4 lit wzero  6C1DD0F9 lit dvb @ 0 lit w!  B20C lit dvb @ 1 lit w!
dvf @ dvd @ 0 lit w!
dvb @ 2 lit dvd @ 1 lit dvc @ wmul           \ A f: 3 words
dva @ 4 lit wzero  dvc @ dva @ 3 lit wcopy
dvf @ dvf @ um*  dvb @ 1 lit w!  dvb @ 0 lit w!   \ f^2: 2 words
39ECD140 lit dvd @ 0 lit w!
dvb @ 2 lit dvd @ 1 lit dvc @ wmul  0 lit dvc @ 3 lit w!
dva @ dvc @ dva @ 4 lit wadd drop
dvf @ dvd @ 0 lit w!
dvb @ 2 lit dvd @ 1 lit dvc @ wmul           \ f^3: 3 words
1407 lit dvd @ 0 lit w!
dvc @ 3 lit dvd @ 1 lit dve @ wmul           \ 5127 f^3: 4 words
dva @ dve @ dva @ 4 lit wadd drop
dvb @ 4 lit wzero  8000 lit dvb @ 1 lit w!   \ 2^47
dva @ dvb @ dva @ 4 lit wadd drop
dva @ dva @ 4 lit 30 lit wshr
dva @ 0 lit w@ 10000 lit + ;

\ nshift ( a -- n )  the 4-word signed a as a word, or +-2^20 if it does not
\ fit: past any shift that matters (a target moves at most 512 bits).
: nshift
dup 0 lit w@ 0< if FFFFFFFF lit else 0 lit then
over 1 lit w@ over =  2 lit pick 2 lit w@ 2 lit pick = and  2 lit pick 3 lit w@ 2 lit pick = and
nip if 0 lit w@ else 3 lit w@ 0< if FFF00000 lit else 100000 lit then then ;

: asert  ( sched eh etlo ethi out -- )
dvinit dvo !  dva @ i64!  dvh !  dvs !
dvs @ 1 lit w@ dvs @ 2 lit w@ dvb @ i64!
dva @ dvb @ dva @ 4 lit wsub drop             \ the time since the anchor's parent
dvb @ 4 lit wzero
dvh @ dvs @ 0 lit w@ - 1 lit + dup dvb @ 0 lit w!  0= if 1 lit dvb @ 1 lit w! then   \ heights since, plus one
dvs @ 4 lit w@ dvd @ 0 lit w!
dvb @ 2 lit dvd @ 1 lit dvc @ wmul  0 lit dvc @ 3 lit w!
dva @ dvc @ dva @ 4 lit wsub drop             \ ahead of schedule (negative) or behind
dva @ dva @ 4 lit 10 lit wshl
dva @ neg? dvg !  dvg @ if dva @ 4 lit ineg then
dvb @ 4 lit wzero  dvs @ 3 lit w@ dvb @ 0 lit w!
dva @ dvb @ dvc @ dvd @ 4 lit wdivmod         \ truncated toward zero
dvg @ if dvc @ 4 lit ineg then                \ dvc: the exponent
dvc @ 0 lit w@ FFFF lit and dvf !            \ its fraction (factor's scratch is these buffers: after)
dvc @ dvd @ 4 lit 10 lit wshr
dvc @ neg? if dvd @ 3 lit w@ FFFF0000 lit or dvd @ 3 lit w! then
dvd @ nshift 10 lit - dvn !                   \ the shift: num_shifts - 16
dvf @ factor dvf !
dve @ A lit wzero  dvf @ dvd @ 0 lit w!
dvs @ 14 lit + 8 lit dvd @ 1 lit dve @ wmul   \ the anchor's target times the factor
dvn @ 1 lit < if
	0 lit dvn @ -  dup 140 lit u> if drop 140 lit then
	dve @ swap dvb @ swap A lit swap wshr
	dvb @ 8 lit w@ dvb @ 9 lit w@ or 0=
else
	dvn @ dup 200 lit u> if drop 200 lit then
	dve @ A lit wbits 0= if
		drop dvb @ 8 lit wzero -1 lit
	else
		dve @ A lit wbits over + 100 lit u> if drop 0 lit else dve @ swap dvb @ swap 8 lit swap wshl -1 lit then
	then
then
if
	dvb @ 8 lit wbits 0= if 1 lit dvb @ 0 lit w! then
	dvb @ dvs @ 34 lit + 8 lit wcmp 0 lit > if dvs @ 34 lit + dvb @ 8 lit wcopy then
else
	dvs @ 34 lit + dvb @ 8 lit wcopy
then
dvb @ dvo @ 8 lit wcopy ;

: wsat+  dup dvu ! 8 lit wadd if dvu @ 8 lit 0 lit do FFFFFFFF lit over i w! loop drop then ;   \ ( a b c -- )

\ bwork ( t out -- )  out = (2^256 - 1 - t) / (t + 1) + 1, saturating:
\ tabminer's work for a target.  The division normalized: t + 1 shifted
\ up under the dividend, then a step a bit of the quotient (a few at
\ the dev networks' targets, a few dozen at a hard one), not 256 as
\ wdivmod's (half a header's checking, measured).
: bws variable ;
: bwork  ( t out -- )
dvinit dvo !
dup dva @ 8 lit wcopy  dvb @ 8 lit wzero  1 lit dvb @ 0 lit w!
dva @ dvb @ dva @ wsat+                       \ d = t + 1
dvc @ 8 lit wcopy  8 lit 0 lit do dvc @ i w@ invert dvc @ i w! loop   \ the remainder from ~t
dvd @ 8 lit wzero                             \ the quotient
dvc @ 8 lit wbits  dva @ 8 lit wbits -  dup 0< if drop else
	bws !
	dva @ dve @ 8 lit bws @ wshl              \ d, its top bit under the dividend's
	bws @ 1 lit + 0 lit do
		dvd @ dvd @ 8 lit 1 lit wshl
		dvc @ dve @ 8 lit wcmp 0< 0= if  dvc @ dve @ dvc @ 8 lit wsub drop  dvd @ @ 1 lit or dvd @ !  then
		dve @ dve @ 8 lit 1 lit wshr
	loop
then
dvd @ dvb @ dvo @ wsat+ ;

: meets  ( digest t -- flag )
dvinit dvt !
dva @ 8 lit wzero
8 lit 0 lit do dva @ dva @ 8 lit 1F lit wshl  dup i w@ dva @ 0 lit w@ or dva @ 0 lit w! loop
drop dva @ dvt @ 8 lit wcmp 1 lit < ;
